<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">FLB ARUM</book>
  <para style="toc1">Filibiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filibiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flb</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO BULUS A NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIBIYAWA</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">A bu Ablusu a ŋa amgbasho ata areh a na kyangwri Filibiyawa mboh nimeh ida Nnoh ata ŋoh ta ka a jiji ma inzi amasara mboh reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Ablusu tasa Timoti ahwra Yeso Kristi mboh. Meh ŋa na amboh tufa Nnoh mboh nza ma a yama ma Filibi reh, tasa agbugba amboh tufa mboh tasa amboh te ndohmoh nimeh ida Nnoh reh. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Ta Nnoh ata nza bu Ada ambohroh tasa Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi ta nga noh lisa alindeh tasa tuma alindeh.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwere Nnoh Tasa Kwende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Meh kǝ kwende ma Nnoh amya na tutu ameh ata meh kohnoh na amohnoh reh, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />tasa za meh kǝ kwere Nnoh na tutu tsifa amohnoh, meh kǝ kwere na johjoh, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />mya meh kwende na amohnoh tsifa ata nza ni dohsoh noh ikpi amohnoh na amya reh, atsi bleh tsifa nana ata jiji reh a gu a ba ba a te nehnehreh. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Tasa za meh bu na kira gaga la akyo ata nza a jiji ndohmoh reh nimeh amohnoh, a nati a leh a rya tohmoh na ndohmoh reh ta a trina fya ibi ata Yeso Kristi nza a nati a ba reh. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />A zohhoh dehreh la meh ti kohnoh na amohnoh nambri, tsifa meh kira na amohnoh gaga. Nnoh reh a leh a te ve na ambohroh nambri, tsifa la ni wina noh la ni nati leh shingi ma nnoh. Tini leh shingi ma nnoh ameh ata meh ti kǝ nimeh ida ka reh, tasa za ni gyuru shingi ma nnoh za ameh ata tama ka ata meh avoh reh la meh ti bleh tsifa nana reh na wuwana. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nnoh a nati a shi a bleh ma ikpi amya, a wina za la mya meh kira na amohnoh nambri tasa kira ata nza anyi na Kristi Yeso reh.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ata areh a bu kwere amya la kira ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh reh ta a leh a bu gaga, meh kwere za la ti lisa wina Nnoh reh alindeh tasa za la ti nza noh awumu amboh ata nza ma a bu zizi reh wina noh, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />la ti wina seh nnoh awumu amboh ata nza a zohhoh a keh mgbiri reh. La ti bu noh na kpakpana kpeh ibi ata Kristi nza a nati a ba reh. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Ti de noh ikpi amohnoh ma aki tufa yehlehleh ata nza bu Yeso Kristi ma ŋoh tsene a nati kira nnoh ti lisa nnoh dehreh, la kyangwri mata nga Nnoh agba tasa mata ariri ŋoh za.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuma Ablusu Ma Inziyo Reh A bu Tsifa Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />ambohroh mboh meh kira ti wina noh la, awumu amboh ata ta ka a hunji meh reh tama a shingi meh meh ti te agba ma atsi bleh tsifa nana. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />amboh de ita mboh nza ma a yama ma afiya Agohmoh reh, tasa mgbiri kyangwri mboh reh ma a wina la ma a ka meh nimeh ida ka ma rishi njehnjehreh reh tsifa la meh bu ahwra nimeh Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Ika ata nza ma a ka meh nimeh ida ka reh, nga wuwa agohsoh ma ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh reh mata a leh a bleh tsifa Nnoh reh na nyiri za kpeh.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />A bu zizi la mgbiri amboh tufa mboh reh ma a leh ahwra akpi Kristi reh tsifa vene tasa kira ikpi, mgbiri feh ma a leh ahwra akpi kristi reh na agohsoh alindeh. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />amboh ata nza ma a leh ahwra tsifa Kristi a bleh tswanza mya nza ni lisa reh, a bu tsifa la ma a kira na amya, ma a wina la ma a ka meh tsifa la meh leh shwa tsifa nana reh. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Mgbiri ma a leh ahwra akpi Kristi reh na agohsoh kira ikpi, a sohroh a bu na agohsoh ata a zizi kpeh, a bu kira amoh la meh ti la wa iya reh mishi nimeh ida ka reh. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ata areh neh a bu andromboh kpeh na amya! nambri ma amoh ma a leh ahwra tsifa Kristi reh a bleh. Ha ma atsifa na kohnoh alindeh ha na kohnoh abibi, ma a leh ahwra akpi Kristi meh bleh. Mya meh nati leh johjoh ma ikpi tsifa reh, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />tsifa la meh wina la kwere Nnoh amohnoh tasa Huru ata nza anyi na Yeso Kristi reh, ma a nati ata meh avoh. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Mya meh kira tasa za meh gya agohsoh la meh ti sohroh gu isa ba ma ikpi amya nimeh ndohmoh Ada reh kpeh, mya neh meh ti tsifa na wuwa agohsoh. Nimeh andromboh ata mya nza ni nati lisa reh, ta mata nga agba ma Kristi nehnehreh tasa ha na ameh atamaa ma mareh, ha meh bu na fene ha meh kwo. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Na amya reh, nza meh bu na fene reh, a bu tsifa Kristi, nza meh kwo reh meh nati rya tohmoh. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Nza neh meh nati tre bu na fene reh, Meh nati wina lisa awumu alilehndeh mboh reh meh ti shingi kyangwri mboh. Meh nati wina la ha ti bu na fene a keh zohhoh ha ti kwo kpeh. Meh wina ata mya nza ni nati seh nimeh reh kpeh. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />meh ti bleh noh zizi, agohsoh amya kǝ gafana a te afri, meh kira meh ti yi awumu inziyo mboh reh ta meh ti na amya na Kristi, wohroh reh a keh meh mgbiri awumu mboh reh zohhoh; <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />nza bu tsifa amohnoh reh feh a keh meh zohhoh la meh ti tre bu na fene. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Mya meh kira na ata areh, meh wina la meh nati tre tuma na amohnoh nambri fya la ti te nnoh agba mishi nnoh tasa johjoh nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />ma aki wohroh reh, nza meh nati gyuru ba na amohnoh reh, johjoh amohnoh nimeh Yeso Kristi reh a nati a lisa a bu gaga. <verse eid="PHP 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Andromboh ata nza a keh zohhoh reh, mohnoh tswanza amboh tufa Kristi reh, de noh ikpi amohnoh tswanza tama ka a tsana noh ameh ata ti kǝ sehreh noh tsifa nana ata Kristi reh. Lisa nnoh dehreh reh la ha meh ba meh ti nza noh, ha meh sehreh tsifa ma ikpi amohnoh ma, Meh nati wina la ni shi na wuwana nimeh huru anyimbehreh, tasa za la na kohnoh anyimbehreh ni nati leh mlana nnoh ma ikpi nga agohsoh ata tsifa nana reh, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />ti kama nyiri nnoh amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tomo reh kpeh mbimbi, ata areh a bu kpra ata nza a tsana la ma a nati a lofona, mohnoh neh ni nati nvara nnoh, ata areh anyi na Nnoh mi. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Andromboh alindeh ata nza a lisa nnoh reh a bu tsifa Kristi, a sohroh a bu tsifa la ni gya noh agohsoh amohnoh mboh na a ŋoh tsene kpeh, a bu tsifa la ni wa nnoh iya tsifa a ŋoh. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Ni nati wa biroh iya ika ata nza ni leh nza ma nnoh atsi wa reh gu ba te nehnehreh.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kuku Ikpi Tasa Agba Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Hende amohnoh nimeh Kristi nga nnoh wuwana, tasa kira a ŋoh ka nga noh soh ivoh yira. Ni kǝ dohsoh noh ikpi na huru reh, tasa ni kǝ lisa nnoh alindeh tasa nza noh kwini itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Meh kwere nnoh la ti nga meh noh nana agohsoh gaga nza ti hende noh na kohnoh amohnoh anyimbehreh, kira amohnoh anyimbehreh, tasa ti bu noh anyimbehreh nimeh huru tasa agohsoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Kama lisa nnoh andromboh na kira ikpi kpeh ha na gu ikpi ka kpeh, de noh itoh amohnoh na kuku ikpi, nza atohngoh anzoh la a keh nnoh. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Kira na andromboh ata atohngoh anzoh nza a kira. Kama kira na ikpi anzoh nnoh tsinzo kpeh, <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Bu nnoh na agohsoh ika ata Kristi Yeso reh:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Ŋoh a tswanza Nnoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">ŋoh neh a sohroh a gu ikpi a ka la ŋoh a tswa na na Nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />A sohroh a gu ikpi a ŋoh la ŋoh bu andromboh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">ta ka a gu ikpi a ŋoh a te ahwra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">ma a mara ŋoh tswanza kyangwri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">a kate a tswanza kyangwri.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Akuku ikpi a ŋoh tasa za a hehndeh ma aki nga agba ma Nnoh a tswa tsi kwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">kwo ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh Nnoh a gu ŋoh a gya a ka atsi agba a ŋoh ata inza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">ta ka nga ŋoh sa ata nza a keh mgbiri sa mboh nambri.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Ma ikpi nga agba ma sa Yeso reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inza nambri, tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inziyo tasa ma hohroh inzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">ma a nati a hwa ada a gboro amoh ma inzi,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />tasa akpokpo arimi tsifa mboh ma a nati a bleh na aniye amoh la Yeso Kristi a bu Ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">tsifa nga agba ma Nnoh Ada.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zanana Nnoh Tswanza Shira Ma Inziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Iziza amya mboh amboh ata mya nza ni kira na amoh, tswanza ti kǝ nga meh noh agba na tutu na ameh ata mya ti kǝ tre bu na amohnoh reh, lisa fi noh ikpi keh ma aki nga meh noh agba reh, nehnehreh mya nza yama na amohnoh kpeh reh neh, te noh ndohmoh na wuwana ti nyiri nnoh Nnoh kǝ nga nnoh nvara, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />la Nnoh buti te ndohmoh nimeh amohnoh ta de noh a te amboh kira tasa ti wina nga noh agba ma ikpi andromboh ata ŋoh nza a kira mata a lisa reh. <verse eid="PHP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Lisa awumu reh nambri kama kpa nnoh aniye ha yaha nnoh aniye kpeh, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />La ti bu noh amboh nza ma a bu na kpakpana kpeh tasa ti bu noh fyafya tswanza mara Nnoh mboh amboh ata nza maka a kpakpana kpeh, amboh ata ni hende noh ma inziyo abibi ata kyangwri mboh amboh kpakpana gaga ma yama. zanana nnoh kanga nimeh amoh tswanza akpukpa mboh nza maka a zana ma inza reh, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />Nza ni nga mboh nnoh tsifa ata fene reh. Nza ni lisa dehreh, meh nati va ivoh ma agohsoh na amohnoh ma ibi ata Kristi nza a nati ba reh, atsifi la areh a nati tsana la wa iya tasa ndohmoh ambohroh a nati bu wusu kpeh. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Nga agohsoh amohnoh tasa ndohmoh amohnoh nimeh Ada tswanza bu awumu nana agohsoh na a ŋoh. Ha ma a nati a wohsoh imya amya a sangra ma ikpi awumu nana agohsoh reh. Meh nati johjoh meh ti nga awumu nana agohsoh reh na nana yira amya na amohnoh nambri. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Ma aki wohroh dehreh, mohnoh za ti johjoh nnoh agohsoh amohnoh ta a kasa kanga na amya.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoti Tasa Abaforiditu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Nza a bu na kira Ada, meh gya agohsoh la a nati yanda kpeh meh nati tohmoh Timoti ba na amohnoh, mya za meh ti sehreh nyi na amohnoh ta akuku meh agohsoh. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Akyo anyi a yama na amya ma mareh tswanza ŋoh kpeh ata nza a kira na anzoh zizi reh. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Mgbiri Kyangwri mboh nambri ma a buti lisa andromboh ata nza a keh wa mboh aniye, andromboh a wa mboh aniye na tsifa Yeso Kristi kpeh. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />mohnoh ni wina noh avoh nza meh bu mbohroh ma Timoti, Ka bu ndohmoh hwra tsifa nana reh ma bleh tswanza amehreh tasa mboh ma alehmeh. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Bu wohroh meh kira meh ti tohmoh ŋoh ba na amohnoh, nza meh nza andromboh nza a buti na na amya. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Nza Ada a kira, mya na ikpi amya za meh nati ba a nati a yanda kpeh. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Meh kohnoh la a nati zohhoh meh ti tohmoh atsi ambohroh Abaforiditu, ata nza ta ka a te ndohmoh tasa a bu iza wa iya amya za, ata nza ti kǝ tohmoh nnoh ba la ta a shingi meh reh. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />A te ŋoh iko la ŋoh ta a nza noh nambri ma amohnoh tasa a kputu agohsoh a ŋoh gaga tsifa la ni sehreh noh la ŋoh a hunji nana itoh kpeh. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Tana leh bishi zizi, tana a ba hwiri na kwo. Nnoh neh ka a nza kwini a ŋoh, tana bu ŋoh tsene kpeh, mya za, ma bu dehreh kpeh, hungwa agohsoh ma a keh meh gaga. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />A bu tsifa wohroh mya nza ni gu ma agohsoh amya la meh nati tohmoh ŋoh ba la agohsoh amohnoh ta a kasa na nza noh za, mya za hungwa agohsoh amya ta a kukuna. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Sa noh kyangwri reh, na johjoh, tswanza a bu atsi amohnoh nimeh Ada reh. Tsana nnoh nga agba ma kyangwri mboh nambri tswanza ŋoh reh. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />tsifa la a gu ikpi a ŋoh nga a ba hwiri ma ta a kwo ma ikpi tsifa ndohmoh Kristi, tsifa la ŋoh ta a shingi meh ata mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni wina nga meh noh kpeh.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Tufa Yehlehleh Ata A zizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ma trina ŋoh, ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, bu noh na johjoh nimeh tuma amohnoh nimeh Ada, a wa meh aniye kpeh la nza meh ti gyuru leh ŋoh <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Lisa kya nnoh iyo na amboh ata nza maka a lisa awumu agugu reh, ma a nata la ma a nati a shimba itoh anzoh, ma a tswanza avava mboh. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />A bu mbohroh, a bu mboh kpeh, ata nza meh kira na a zizi shimba kpa reh, mbohroh amboh ata nza meh leh krumusu Nnoh ma aki huru zanana reh, tasa meh johjoh nimeh fene ambohroh nza a bu na Kristi Yeso reh. Mbohroh meh sohroh gya agohsoh ambohroh na ndohmoh itoh kyangwri kpeh. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Nza bu mya reh, meh nati wina kira na awumu amboh wohroh. Nza akyo anyi a yama ata nza a nati a wina gya agohsoh na itoh Kyangwri mboh, mya meh keh ŋoh. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Ma shimba kpa amya na wohroh meh bu na ibi atsiyatsiya, mya meh bu a zizi israila, ata mya nza ni nyi alohsoh Benyamin, meh bu a zizi kyangwri Ibraniyawa. Ma ikpi tufa tsana lomo akpi reh, mya tini bu kyangwri Farisiyawa, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Ma kpi rya tohmoh ma aki tufa mya meh nga iya ma duma amboh tufa mboh. Nza kyangwri a nati tufa yehlehleh ma aki tufa akpi reh, mya meh bu na kpakpana kpeh. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Mya neh andromboh ata ta ka a bu nimeh na hunji gaga reh, nehnehreh ma za a bu andromboh na amya za kpeh, tsifa meh nga kira amya ma Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />A bu awumu amboh ata areh ma kpeh, meh nza awumu mboh reh nambri tswanza ma bu andromboh kpeh na amya, tsifa andromboh ata nza a keh zohhoh, wohroh reh a bu lomo Kristi Yeso ata nza bu Ada amya reh. Ma ikpi tsifa a ŋoh reh, meh fira awumu mboh reh nambri sangra; meh gu mboh la ma a bu awumu abibi, tsifa la meh ti hunji Kristi, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />tasa za meh ti tuma nimeh a ŋoh. Ata areh a sohroh a bu tsifa tufa yehlehleh amya ma aki tufa akpi reh kpeh. A bu ma aki tufa yehlehleh ata nza anyi na nga agohsoh ata nza a bu nimeh Kristi, tufa yehlehleh ata nza anyi na Nnoh ma aki nga agohsoh. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Mya meh kira meh ti wina Kristi tasa wuwana hinga ŋoh anyi ma kwo reh, tasa za ti dohsoh noh ikpi amohnoh nimeh wa iya a ŋoh tasa za ti bu noh tswanza ŋoh nimeh kwo a ŋoh, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />nimeh gya agohsoh la mata a yiri meh anyi ma kwo meh ti bu na fene yama.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fa Aki Ti Rya tomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Mya meh sohroh gu la meh hunji awumu mboh reh nambri kpeh, ha meh ti bu yehlehleh kpeh, meh tre leh fa aki la meh ti rya firoh, tsifa la Kristi Yeso kǝ wa meh na ma itoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, andromboh anyimbehreh ata mya meh kǝ lisa reh, meh kǝ te kohhroh na andromboh ata kǝ gǝga reh, meh kǝ fa aki andromboh ata nza a treh a bu ma tohmoh reh. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Meh leh nata meh ti hunji firoh rya tohmoh, wohroh reh a bu fi Nnoh na Kristi Yeso a gu a na na fene ata nza a bu ma inza. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Nza ka a bu dehreh nambri ma ambohroh ata meh te agba nimeh huru reh, meh ti bu na kohnoh ata areh. Nza mgbiri amohnoh neh ni bu noh na kohnoh anyi tse, Nnoh a nati a gyuru a tsana noh ata areh za. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Andromboh ata nza a zohhoh nehnehreh, a bu atsi ata mbohroh nza meh bu reh, meh ti leh rya tohmoh nyi ma mareh.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, mya meh kira la ti gu nnoh hwana amya, mohnoh za ti nza noh amboh ata tufa amoh nza a zohhoh ika ata timi kǝ tsana noh reh. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Kyangwri amboh anyi ma a yama ata mya nza ni leh bleh noh tsifa ma ikpi amoh. Mya meh gyuru bleh noh nehnehreh za na mwueneh la, hende amoh a de mboh tufa amboh ata nza ma a fi kwo Kristi ma tohmoh ma gbohrohgboh . <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Trina amoh a nati a bu lofona nimeh shira, tsifa la nnoh amoh a bu andromboh ata itoh amoh ariri. Ma a leh a gu ikpi amoh a ka na andromboh ata nza a nati a te mboh na sa, tasa za kohnoh amoh a bu ma ikpi awumu inziyo areh ma. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Mbohroh neh, afiya ambohroh a bu ma inza, mbohroh meh leh bana ŋoh ata nza a bati a sa reh a hwana, Ada Yeso Kristi, ata nza a nati anyi inza a ba reh. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />A nati a sehneh reh itoh ambohroh mboh nza a bu na wuwana kpeh ma inziyo areh, a nati a lisa itoh mboh reh mata a stwanza a ŋoh nza maka nga ŋoh agba reh, ŋoh a bu na wuwana ata nza a nati a de awumu mboh reh nambri a ba ma hohroh de Agohmoh a ŋoh.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Kpi Ashotoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Nza a bu dehreh, iziza amya mboh, meh kira na amohnoh vevekpeh tasa za a te meh iko nza noh! Ni nga meh noh nana agohsoh, tasa za meh rya itoh ma ikpi amohnoh! a bu wohroh reh shi wuwana nnoh ma aki Ada. <verse eid="PHP 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Meh kwere nnoh Yudiya tasa Sintiki, kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh la ni bu noh asra mboh nimeh Ada. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Tasa nnoh za, atohngoh amya ata a zizi, meh kira ti shingǝ ifiya mboh reh; mboh reh ma a te ndohmoh vevekpeh nimeh hwra tsifa nana Yeso a bleh, mbohroh ma Kileme tasa mgbiri amboh ndohmoh amya mboh, amboh ata isa amoh nza a bu nimeh amgbasho Nnoh ata amboh fene mboh. <verse eid="PHP 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Johjoh ta a bu na amohnoh nimeh dohsohna amohnoh na Ada. Meh gyuru bleh za la: johjoh nnoh!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Te nnoh ve na kyangwri mboh nambri. Ada a nati a ba fifi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Andromboh ta a kama a wa nnoh aniye kpeh, nimeh kwere amohnoh neh luhu nnoh Nnoh andromboh ata nza ni kira nnoh, kǝ kwere nnoh Nnoh na agohsoh ata kwende. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Alindeh ata Nnoh, ata nza a keh lomo kohnoh kyangwri, ta a de agohsoh amohnoh tasa kohnoh amohnoh a gya alindeh nimeh kristi Yeso.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Ma trina ŋoh, ambohroh amboh tufa mboh, ta agohsoh amohnoh ta bu na awumu alilehndeh tasa ta a bu na ringa mboh: Awumu amboh ata nza ma bu zizi, alindeh, yehlehleh, kira, a bu na nga agba. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza ni nza nyi nnoh na amya reh, nza nyi nnoh ma tsifa amya tasa nimeh ndohmoh amya mboh. Nnoh ata nza a nga reh tuma alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu A kwende Ma Ikpi Awumu Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Nimeh fene amya na ada, a de johjoh a ba meh gaga la ameh kǝ yanda dehreh, ni tre tsana noh la ni kira nnoh na amya. Meh sohroh bleh la tini leke meh noh kpeh, tini sohroh hunji noh aki kpeh. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Tasa meh sohroh bleh dehreh la ma a yi meh ata tsimya kpeh, mya meh wina tuma nimeh iya tasa nimeh nana. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Mya meh nza iya wina, tasa meh wina andromboh ata nza maka a fi la nana. Meh kpeh lomo ata ayuhu ata areh la ha meh na ama, ha na ameh ata ama, ha meh hunu ha meh leh na nyo, ha meh bu na asabara ha meh bu na iya. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Meh nati wina shi nimeh iya mboh nambri na wuwana ata Kristi nza nga meh.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Dehreh za neh, tana a zohhoh na amohnoh ti kǝ shingi meh noh ameh ata meh ti kǝ bu nimeh iya reh. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />mohnoh Filibiyawa mboh ni wina noh la, ameh ata meh ti kǝ leh jiji hwra tsifa nana bleh ma akpo inzi Makidoniya reh, a bu mohnoh amboh tufa Yeso mboh ti kǝ leh shingi meh noh reh, tasa za a bu mohnoh ti kǝ leh gafa nnoh awumu amohnoh na amya reh. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Ameh ata meh ti kǝ bu ma Tasalonika reh, tini kǝ shingi meh noh na awumu ata mya nza ni kira reh. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Kama nza noh amohnoh la meh kira ti leh nga meh noh ngǝnga ma tsene kpeh, meh kira meh ti nza rya tohmoh na andromboh ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh reh. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ma a fanga meh nambri, fanga ata meh nati wina bleh kpeh. Andromboh ata mya nza ni kira reh meh hunji, mya meh sa ngǝnga ata nza ni nga nnoh Abaforiditu la ta a de a ba meh reh. Ata areh a tswanza a bu ngǝnga ata angǝshi alindeh ata nana agohsoh ata Nnoh nza a kira reh. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Nnoh amya a nati a fanga nnoh andromboh ata nza ni kira nnoh reh a nza anyi na agba asabara a ŋoh nimeh Kristi Yeso. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Zizi nga agba tasa riri a tswa mata nga ma Ada Nnoh ambohroh ata tuma atono! Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Ata Trinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Tsifa meh noh na amboh tufa mboh nza ma a bu na zanana nimeh Kristi Yeso reh. Ambohroh mboh nza ma a bu na amya ma mare za ma atsifa na amohnoh. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Kyangwri Nnoh amboh zanana nza ma a bu ma mareh za ma atsifa na amohnoh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh ma afiya kaisar reh.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Ta lisa alindeh ata Ada Yeso Kristi ta a bu na huru amohnoh nambri. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>